   "body": "The 2025 median of $2,210,651 marks the seventh straight year of appreciation from the 2018 baseline of $1,437,000 \u2014 a 53.8% gain compounding at ~6.3% annually. 2026 year-to-date is running at $2,400,000 (+8.6%). Structural scarcity has kept values resilient through every rate environment."
